<title>USA: Fla. Muni Power to sell $57 mln Wednesday at 1100.</title>
<headline>Fla. Muni Power to sell $57 mln Wednesday at 1100.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida Municipal Power Agency will sell $57 million of revenue bonds on Wednesday, February 26, at 1100 EST through a competitive sale.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
